    brn_p_customers: 'Parties',
    brn_pd_customers: 'One shelf per party, read off the counterparty: Active and Expired, grouped by stream. Nothing is filed.',
    brn_p_overview: 'Details',
    brn_pd_overview: 'The deal, the record, and what Jambo read.',
    brn_p_constellation: 'Constellation',
    brn_pd_constellation: 'The deal as a map on Details: every party, its people, and the money and duties that pass between them.',
    brn_p_directory: 'Directory',
    brn_pd_directory: 'Everyone HaTi deals with, inside and outside, as a wall of contact cards: a reading off the roster, every contract\'s people list and the imported list. Nothing filed.',
    brn_p_listhead: 'The list head',
    brn_pd_listhead: 'One head for every list page: a box to search or ask in, the page\'s views as tabs counted with their rows, filters only once they are added, as chips, and Columns. The page owns every reading; the head counts and keeps nothing.',
    brn_p_listfoot: 'The list foot',
    brn_pd_listfoot: 'Under every list: "1–40 of 189 · Show 40 more", the page\'s own page size, read aloud as it moves.',
    brn_p_timemachine: 'Time Machine',
