    brn_p_copilotask: 'Jambo prepares',
    brn_pd_copilotask: 'The ask box reads @ people and # contracts with no model, and answers with a card that waits for one press.',
    brn_p_walkset: 'A set read in Workspace',
    brn_pd_walkset: 'An answer naming several contracts is read in Workspace one at a time, with Previous and Next.',
    brn_p_approvalpaper: 'An approval, opened where it is decided',
    brn_pd_approvalpaper: 'The bell and the checklist open an approval waiting on you on the Approvals & signing page, with its row chosen. It is no longer a Board row.',
    brn_p_dealpaper: 'Their changes on the paper in Workspace',
    brn_pd_dealpaper: 'Clean | Redline | Their view on Home\'s paper: the redlines\' own marks, read-only; the deal board on the Board sorts their changes, and the redlines beside the paper answer them.',
    brn_p_decidedsend: 'Send our answers back',
    brn_pd_decidedsend: 'Their asks decided and nothing of ours unsent: "Whose move" reads Mine and "Send to them" stands in the Redlines column until the answers go back.',
    brn_p_onepaper: 'One paper everywhere',
    brn_pd_onepaper: 'Home\'s Workspace (Clean, Redlined and Their view), the phone\'s Negotiate page and their page draw the same paper on the same ground; only the redlines come and go.',
    brn_p_answeronpaper: 'Jambo\'s answer on the paper',
    brn_pd_answeronpaper: 'An answer you asked Jambo to redo is drawn on the paper in dashed marks, and the verb that makes it yours glows. Nothing is filed or sent until you press.',
    brn_p_chasemany: 'Chase many at once',
    brn_pd_chasemany: 'A ticked list over the late promises, one question, each chase the obligation\'s own act, and one honest line after.',
