    brn_pd_copilotdoors: 'Asks like hold it, send it for signing or what is still open become a card whose one press opens HaTi\'s own screen for that act.',
    brn_p_draftreply: 'A drafted reply',
    brn_pd_draftreply: 'For a note nobody answered, Jambo drafts a reply on a press; Use this reply puts it in the note\'s own reply box to send.',
    brn_p_putaway: 'Put away a prepared piece',
    brn_pd_putaway: 'Every piece of Jambo\'s work can be put away: a desk row on the contract, anything else for you alone; the work it is about stays owed. Undo for a few seconds.',
    brn_p_chaseletter: 'The chase letter',
    brn_pd_chaseletter: 'One letter for a late promise of theirs: Look on the Board\'s Jambo\'s work card draws it and the chase route sends it, signed by the person who presses.',
