    brn_pd_askchoice: 'A word that can mean two things — value, terms, owner, stage — is drawn with the likeliest reading, the assumption is said, and the other reading is one press.',
    brn_p_boardwords: 'The company\'s board words',
    brn_pd_boardwords: 'An admin says what the company\'s own words mean on the board (\u201cBU\u201d is the value stream); the board reads them before anything else, and Jambo is told.',
    brn_p_readchips: 'The reading, as chips',
    brn_pd_readchips: 'Under a reply: Picture · Split · Measure, each opening the card\'s own menu; a change made right after an answer is recorded as a possible misreading.',
    brn_p_nextq: 'Three next questions',
    brn_pd_nextq: 'Up to three follow-up questions under a reply, each one the free reader can answer.',
    brn_p_cellfold: 'Bubbles in every view',
    brn_pd_cellfold: 'Fold all works on Floors, Grid and Timeline too: each group becomes one bubble per cell, holding exactly the dots it opens into.',
    brn_p_boardmarks: 'Right or wrong',
    brn_pd_boardmarks: 'Two quiet marks at a reply\'s foot; each press is one row your admins can read and settle.',
    brn_p_boardjudge: 'Jambo accuracy, measured',
    brn_pd_boardjudge: 'Every Monday the board\'s own question book is asked of Jambo and judged by one judge; admins see the score and the misses in Settings.',
    brn_p_factsheet: 'The fact sheet',
    brn_pd_factsheet: 'Every summary Jambo writes on the board starts from HaTi\'s own fact sheet: the totals, the reading, what was not read; a sentence with a number not on it is removed.',
    brn_p_packs: 'Answer packs',
    brn_p_phrasebook: 'The analyst\'s phrasebook',
    brn_pd_phrasebook: 'An analyst\'s way of asking — QoQ, year to date, breakdown, concentration, deal size, Q2 2026 — read in the board\'s own words, so it is answered free.',
    brn_p_story: 'Stories',
    brn_pd_story: 'A trend told in four chapters — friction, renewals, spend, pipeline, risk, payment terms, obligations, one counterparty, one stream, the quarter — each a chart HaTi counts, with Jambo\'s words checked number by number; Dig deeper finds what drove it.',
    brn_pd_packs: 'Four ready answers for the questions that matter most (top risks, money ending, standards, the next 12 months), worked out by HaTi for free.',
    brn_p_analyst: 'Dig deeper',
    brn_pd_analyst: 'On a press, Jambo works an open question out in up to five steps, HaTi counting each one; the steps are shown.',
    brn_p_bookread: 'The whole book, read overnight',
    brn_pd_bookread: 'Unless an admin turns it off, each contract is read once for its key terms and checked against our standards, so the board can chart what contracts say.',
    brn_p_dealfacts: 'Chart the deal facts',
    brn_pd_dealfacts: 'Split any card by whose move, negotiation rounds, overdue duties, renewal decision or risks found — read off what the list already carries.',
    brn_p_verified: 'Verified views',
    brn_pd_verified: 'An admin saves a card as the company\'s answer to named questions; asking one draws that card, marked Verified, counted over your own contracts.',
    brn_p_askpreview: 'See it while you type',
    brn_pd_askpreview: 'One faint line over the ask box says how the board will read the question, and whether it is free or goes to Jambo.',
    brn_p_boardmoved: 'What moved, in the brief',
    brn_pd_boardmoved: 'The daily or weekly brief carries your board\'s top three findings, as of the day they were counted, each with a link that opens its chart.',
    brn_pd_cardcheck: 'Before a card Jambo built goes on the board it is checked — no contracts, a date most lack, too many groups, money hidden, no history for a trend; a failing card goes back to Jambo once, and what still fails is said, never drawn.',
    brn_pd_dataguide: 'Every question asked on Home\'s board carries a guide to the book: how many contracts carry each date, group and measure, the ranges and the top values — so Jambo builds cards on fields that are filled. No money for a reader who may not see it.',
    brn_pd_boardtools: 'Asked on Home\'s board, Jambo answers with a list of the board\'s own buttons — add, change, remove, arrange, name, filter — and one applier presses them in order, saying each.',
    brn_pd_recipe: 'Every chart on Home is one short recipe — which contracts, split, second split, measure, picture, order, top N, period, comparison and name — written by a question, a dropdown or Jambo, and drawn by one planner that says what it could not draw.',
