    brn_p_askadmin: 'Ask an admin',
    brn_pd_askadmin: 'A colleague asks Jambo for a company rule; Jambo sends the ask with their reason.',
    brn_p_govrule: 'Through the rules, never around',
    brn_pd_govrule: 'Every Jambo instruction that answers a person carries one rule: say what the rule is, who can lift it and the proper next step, never a way around it.',
    brn_p_ruledoor: 'The door through a rule',
    brn_pd_ruledoor: 'When a rule stops someone, Jambo\'s answer carries that rule\'s own button: Ask an admin, Ask for review or Send for approval. It opens the door; the person presses.',
    brn_p_aigoto: 'Jambo takes you there',
    brn_pd_aigoto: 'When Jambo\'s word reader cannot place a question, the AI\'s answer may name one place in HaTi; the page opens through the same door the words would use. It opens pages only, never an admin\'s for anybody else. An admin can switch it off.',
    brn_p_privpage: 'A folder\'s own page',
    brn_pd_privpage: 'In Settings, a folder\'s page says how many contracts it holds, who may open them and whether its money is counted. An admin makes it private there and names who may open it.',
    brn_p_privwall: 'Who may open which folder',
    brn_pd_privwall: 'The server\'s one answer to which folders a person may open. A private folder that does not name someone is shut to them, admins included, so its contracts never reach them.',
    brn_p_privsave: 'Saving a private folder',
    brn_pd_privsave: 'The one place a private folder is changed. It refuses a private folder with nobody named, and records who was named or removed, by whom and when.',
    brn_p_privtrail: 'Who opened it, in its History',
    brn_pd_privtrail: 'A private contract\'s History draws each open as a quiet line with an eye, beside who was named or removed; the Filter can hide them or show only them.',
    brn_p_privlist: 'Reading the private folders',
    brn_pd_privlist: 'An admin reads every private folder with how many contracts each holds, counted on the server even where the admin is not named.',
    brn_p_privseen: 'The bell line, read',
    brn_pd_privseen: 'A named person presses away the line that said somebody named themself; only they can, and only for themselves.',
    brn_p_privopens: 'Who opened a private contract',
    brn_pd_privopens: 'Every time someone opens a contract in a private folder, the server records it: one line per person per sitting.',
    brn_p_privmoney: 'Private money is not added',
    brn_p_paysec: 'Pay, on an employment contract',
    brn_pd_paysec: 'An employment contract\'s panel shows the job\'s facts and a Pay table — base pay, allowances, a bonus — and Edit pay is the one door to change it, frozen once signed.',
    brn_p_payread: 'Pay is not deal value',
    brn_pd_payread: 'An employment contract\'s money is a person\'s pay: it keeps its place for the signing limit, but no total, list column or Jambo figure ever adds it.',
    brn_p_jbpress: 'Private: read only on a press',
    brn_p_ndatail: 'An NDA\'s secrecy, on its life line',
    brn_pd_ndatail: 'An NDA\'s panel says Secret until and who keeps it secret, draws the kept-secret tail after the sharing ends, and Edit confidentiality is the one door; a confirmed date brings a reminder a month before.',
    brn_p_ndaread: 'An NDA\'s two facts, read off the wording',
    brn_pd_ndaread: 'Who discloses and how long secrecy lasts, read off the wording with no model and nothing spent; shown with a confirm mark until a person confirms, never guessed.',
    brn_p_trailpage: 'The trail, as a file',
    brn_pd_trailpage: 'Data & backup\'s The trail tab: an admin picks a period, the streams and a spreadsheet or a sealed PDF, sees the count before pressing, and sees every download so far.',
    brn_p_trailsum: 'How many acts the trail holds',
    brn_pd_trailsum: 'Counts the acts, streams and people in the period asked, inside the admin\'s own stream wall, and how many private streams are left out.',
