    brn_p_trailexport: 'The trail\'s file',
    brn_pd_trailexport: 'Builds the spreadsheet or the PDF from every contract\'s audit lines, the opens of private contracts and the trail\'s own downloads, with the SHA-256 seal, and records the download before the file leaves.',
    brn_p_youform: 'A form in its row',
    brn_pd_youform: 'On Your settings a form opens under the row that asked for it — away, two-step, name, email, password, devices, points — the same form and Save its drawer has.',
    brn_p_myemail: 'Changing your own email',
    brn_pd_myemail: 'With your current password; an address another member uses is refused; the change is recorded in the trail.',
    brn_p_mycopy: 'Your own copy',
