    brn_p_acctrec: 'Account acts, recorded',
    brn_pd_acctrec: 'A name changed, an email changed, a copy taken: each a row the trail reads.',
    brn_p_streamside: 'A stream beside its list',
    brn_pd_streamside: 'A row on Contract streams shows the stream in the side panel: who may open it, what is kept and due, what is on legal hold, and its acts.',
    brn_p_clashseen: 'The day a clash was first seen',
    brn_pd_clashseen: 'The server keeps the day HaTi first saw each clash in who may do what, so its row in Needs your attention says since when; a clash that goes away is forgotten.',
    brn_p_clashfind: 'Which clashes there are',
    brn_pd_clashfind: 'One reading of the clashes in who may do what, asked by the Settings page and by the server alike, so the server stamps a clash on the day a change makes it, whether or not an admin is looking.',
    brn_p_trailrec: 'The record of trail downloads',
    brn_pd_trailrec: 'One line per download of the trail, so handing over the record is itself on the record.',
    brn_p_rolespage: 'Business roles',
    brn_pd_rolespage: 'Company › People › Roles: named sets of rights HaTi already has; a change says who it reaches before it saves, and moves only the rights a holder had from the role.',
    brn_p_bzsection: 'A person\'s business role',
    brn_pd_bzsection: 'The top of a person\'s drawer: choosing a role fills the drawer\'s own controls, says what the role brings and lists the person\'s extras; Save writes each right as before.',
