    int_ob_time_a: 'Completing an obligation sets it to <b>done</b> and writes a line in the contract’s history — but the record itself keeps <b>no completion date</b>. Across {n} completed commitments, “finished on time” and “finished three weeks late” are the same word on the same field.',
