    brn_p_hatisearch: "One search over HaTi",
    brn_pd_hatisearch: "Everything a person may see, found by words: contracts, the passages of their wording, obligations, notes, history, parties, requests, people, templates and our standards. Kept current by the database itself; the walls (streams, private streams, code names, drafts, a person's own notes) are asked off the live record before anything is handed back. Free.",
