    brn_p_aidoor: "The exact door Jambo names, checked",
    brn_pd_aidoor: "When Jambo takes someone somewhere he names the exact thing by the ids his tools returned: a clause, a contract's tab, Contracts narrowed, a party, a setting, a person, a standard, a template, a duty, a request. The server keeps only a door this person may stand at; the rest is dropped before the browser sees it.",
