    brn_pd_navdoor: "The door Jambo named, turned into the move HaTi already makes for a typed ask: the same doors, the same landing, the same \"not there\" line. It opens and chooses; it never sends, signs, approves or deletes.",
    brn_p_aifirst: "Jambo answers when the free reading only guesses",
    brn_pd_aifirst: "A free reading that is sure acts at once and costs nothing. One that only guesses — a close match, a contract opened when the sentence asks something of it, a question beside an open contract about another — gives way to Jambo, who reads all of HaTi. With no engine the free reading stays, so nothing is left with no answer.",
    brn_p_wayon: "Never a dead end",
    brn_pd_wayon: "When Jambo cannot finish, he says why and offers the nearest things the one search finds, as presses, with Ask again. Every step may search; the last one must answer; a reply with no words is asked once more.",
    brn_p_hswords: "The words a search looks for",
    brn_pd_hswords: "The same on both hosts: words that carry no meaning dropped, everyday endings forgiven, a misspelt word read as the words the book holds one slip away. Meaning is Jambo's: he hands the likely words.",
    brn_pd_navread: "One reading, asked first in every Jambo box: a clause of a contract by number or name, a party's folder, Contracts narrowed by stream, stage, party and end. It lands through the doors that already exist, says plainly what is not there, and asks which was meant when a name matches two. Free; it presses nothing.",
