    brn_p_pushalerts: 'Alerts on your phone',
    brn_pd_pushalerts: "A person turns alerts on for one device in Settings, You (or the phone's account sheet). Urgent things arrive as they happen (your turn to sign, an approval asked of you, a duty of yours due today) and the rest in one summary each morning, read off the daily brief. An alert names the contract, never its wording or a figure, and never a code-named deal; a tap opens HaTi on it.",
